.TH SHAKE_UPDATE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
shake_update \- Advance the shake: pick this tick's random offset into s\->ox / s\->oy and decay the amplitude
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "void shake_update(Shake *s, float dt);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Advance the shake: pick this tick's random offset into s\->ox / s\->oy and decay the amplitude. Call from update, then read the offsets in render or copy them to the camera.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR shake_start (3),
.BR Camera (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
